<title>POLAND: BANK GDANSKI SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 5.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>BANK GDANSKI SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 5.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  5.90 vs    4.90</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   12.80 vs    9.15</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 36.93 vs   28.67</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	61.38 vs   55.16</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 69.59 vs   83.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  118.37 vs  155.61</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		291.95 vs  257.42</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     545.11 vs  473.77</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
